OL,3,GNEWSAUnopened vintage Christmas
OL,4,Acrackers up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA box of 12 unopened Christmas crackers
OL,7,Fbelieved to be about 100 years old is
OL,8,Fgoing up for auction.
OL,10,FThe original box was discovered in a
OL,11,Fwardrobe at John Goddard's house in
OL,12,FGainsborough, Lincolnshire.
OL,14,FHis daughters, Nicky Goddard and Karen
OL,15,FGrundy, think the crackers were given
OL,16,Fto their grandparents in the 1920s or
OL,17,F1930s by freinds in Mablethorpe before
OL,18,Fbeing passed down to their parents as a
OL,19,Fwedding gift.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
