OL,3,GNEWSAUnopened vintage Christmas
OL,4,Acrackers up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FKaren said: "Whoever ends up buying
OL,7,Fthese crackers... please do open them
OL,8,Fand look inside and enjoy them.
OL,9,FObviously they've been kept very very
OL,10,Fsafe, and we've only ever been able to
OL,11,Flook at them."
